1  | 遍历视口行与单元格              | 有 | RowIterator::new             | render.rs | ghostty_render_state_row_iterator_new/next; ghostty_render_state_row_cells_new/next (render.h)
2  | 单元格字符与宽度/续格标记    | 有 | fn graphemes                 | render.rs | ghostty_grid_ref_graphemes (grid_ref.h); ghostty_cell_get (screen.h)
2  | 单元格宽度/续格                   | 有 | fn wide                      | screen.rs | ghostty_cell_get wide 字段 (screen.h)
