3  | 样式属性(bold/underline/inverse...)  | 有 | pub struct Style             | style.rs | ghostty_style_default (style.h)
4  | 光标位置                             | 有 | fn cursor_x                  | terminal.rs | ghostty_terminal_get TERMINAL_OPT_CURSOR (terminal.h)
4  | 光标可见性/样式                   | 有 | fn cursor_visible            | render.rs | ghostty_render_state_get CURSOR_* (render.h)
5  | 脏行/脏标记                         | 有 | fn next_dirty                | render.rs | ghostty_render_state_row_iterator_next_dirty (render.h)
6  | 滚动偏移                             | 有 | fn viewport_row              | render.rs | ghostty_render_state_get ROW_ITERATOR 相关 (render.h)
6  | scrollback 总行数                     | 有 | fn scrollback_rows           | terminal.rs | ghostty_terminal_get TERMINAL_OPT_HISTORY_ROWS 类 (terminal.h)
7  | 滚动操作(按行/顶/底)             | 有 | fn scroll_viewport           | terminal.rs | ghostty_terminal_scroll_viewport (terminal.h:3585)
8  | resize                                   | 有 | fn resize                    | terminal.rs | ghostty_terminal_resize (terminal.h:3289)
9  | alternate screen 状态                  | 有 | fn active_screen             | terminal.rs | ghostty_terminal_get SCREEN 类 (terminal.h)
10 | 选区/可复制文本提取             | 有 | fn format_selection_buf      | selection.rs | ghostty_terminal_select_word/select_line (selection.h:771)
11 | 终端模式标志(mouse/paste/app-cursor) | 有 | fn mode                      | terminal.rs | ghostty_terminal_get MODE + modes.h 常量 (terminal.h/modes.h)

